  "description": "Optional read-write external data-plane API add-on for Orleans.Lattice. Exposes a transport-agnostic facade (and, via a sibling binding, a gRPC surface) that lets non-.NET clients set, delete, atomically batch, point-read, and bounded-range-read tree entries. Every operation routes through the gated ILattice grain surface, so the authorization wired into the cluster fires automatically once the caller identity flows. Opt-in and absent by default; registered with a single AddLatticeDataApi(...) call.",
